        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I kind of went with everything that hadn&#39;t made an effort to be difficult to get to, for example (Spoilers) [color=white]In issue 1 when dealing with the spider hordes at the tree she could hit everyone, except for the snipers who fortified positions on teh walls and were trying to be difficult.That way any minion who isn&#39;t listed as defending or deliberatly being difficult should be fair game.[/color] I figure that&#39;s a fair way to work thorough it without being too stingy. Speedsters are notorious Mary Sue&#39;s. as anyone who&#39;s read the flash for very long can attest to. Christopher &amp; Adam even talk about it in her Letters page. On the other hand minions are supposed to be weak and this is one of the few super hero games that isn&#39;t a single player video game that brings that accross well\n",
